@host = https://localhost:7227

### 1. Create a user
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha",
  "email": "asha@example.com"
}

### 2. Get all users
GET {{host}}/api/users

### 3. Get user by id
GET {{host}}/api/users/1

### 4. Update user
PUT {{host}}/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Asha K",
  "email": "asha.k@example.com"
}

### 5. Delete user
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/1

### 6. Get a user that doesn't exist (should return 404)
GET {{host}}/api/users/999